---
description: No inline backticks in docs or docstrings.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No inline backticks

Do not wrap identifiers, extensions, paths, or examples in backticks in
docstrings, comments, or markdown prose.

- Wrong: ``supported_file_types``, `supported_file_types`, ``.csv``
- Right: supported_file_types, .csv, [".csv"]

Fenced code blocks (triple backticks) are the only backticks allowed.
Copying an existing docstring is not an exception. Rewrite the wrap.
